{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":41681462,"ns":0,"title":"Consciousness causes collapse","extract":"The postulate that consciousness causes collapse is the main ingredient of an interpretation of quantum mechanics in which consciousness is the mechanism behind the process of measurement in quantum mechanics. It is a historical interpretation of quantum mechanics that is largely discarded by modern physicists.","description":"Interpretation of quantum mechanics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}